        "150970100": {
          "id": 150970100,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "안녕, 반가워~",
          "next": [
            150970101
          ]
        },
        "150970101": {
          "id": 150970101,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "저기… 누구 있어? 뭐, 있다고 치자",
          "next": [
            150970102
          ]
        },
        "150970102": {
          "id": 150970102,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "누군가 네게 메시지를 남겼어~",
          "next": [
            150970103
          ]
        },
        "150970103": {
          "id": 150970103,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "「꼬마 녀석들을 모두 찾아줘서 고마워. 녀석들이 널 위해 답례를 준비했으니, 시간 날 때 『친구의 비밀 기지』로 와서 받아 가!」",
          "next": [
            150970104
          ]
        },
        "150970104": {
          "id": 150970104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "「그리고! 내가 2차원 시티에도 선물을 하나 남겨뒀어. 구체적인 위치는…」",
          "next": [
            150970106
          ]
        },
        "150970105": {
          "id": 150970105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "그럼, 거기서 기다릴게~",
          "next": []
        },
        "150970106": {
          "id": 150970106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "1. 환월이 보이는 곳이야!",
          "next": [
            150970107
          ]
        },
        "150970107": {
          "id": 150970107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "2. 높은 곳이야!",
          "next": [
            150970108
          ]
        },
        "150970108": {
          "id": 150970108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "3. 철 상자가 네 발밑에서 움직이는 곳이야!",
          "next": [
            150970109
          ]
        },
        "150970109": {
          "id": 150970109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 244,
          "text": "「힌트는 이게 전부야, 찾아봐!」",
          "next": [
            150970105
          ]
        }
